(card "exp:D-R1-2_isolated_keep" :type "experiment"
  :subj "exp:D-R1-2_isolated_keep"
  :body "---\nnav: 26\ntype: experiment\nid: D-R1-2_isolated_keep\nshort_name: isolated_keep\ntitle: \"D-R1-2 — anchor + post-filter keep lc_24h == 0 (anchor-only / cold-source alpha)\"\narc: 260516a\nteam: d\nround: r1\nparent_arc: \"[[arcs/260516a]]\"\nparent_lineage: \"[[lineages/arc_260516a__team_d__blacklist_default_admit]]\"\ntrain_nav: 2.0927\ntrain_trade_count: 124\ntrain_win_rate: 0.8710\ntrain_sharpe: 8.1992\ntrain_max_drawdown: -0.0101\nval_nav_mean: 1.0571\nval_nav_sigma: 0.0694\nval_window_count: 13\ntest_nav: null\ntest_trade_count: null\ntest_sharpe: null\ntest_win_rate: null\ntest_max_drawdown: null\nanchor_train_nav: 2.1882\nanchor_test_nav: 1.2486\nstatus: falsified\noutcome: no_test_run\nchampion: false\noverfit_score: 0\nleak_audit: clean\naxis: [whitelist, cross_source]\npast_only_window_days: null\nwarmup_required: null\ncreated: 2026-05-17T02:00:00\nlast_updated: 2026-05-17T05:09:00\ntags: [arc/260516a, team/d, round/r1, axis/whitelist, axis/cross_source, status/falsified, outcome/no_test_run, leak/clean, size/medium]\n---\n\n# D-R1-2 — anchor + keep lc_24h == 0 (isolated leg only)\n\n> **TL;DR** —— D-R1-2 = \"**反向 R1-1**\"：只保留 anchor-source 独占的 leg (lc_24h == 0，过去 24h 无 cross-source echo)，假设 cold-source alpha 没被别人吃过。**train NAV 2.09 < anchor 2.19**，砍 16 笔后未带来 NAV 提升，未上 test。\n\n## 假设 (Hypothesis)\n- 假设：anchor-source 独占的 leg = cold alpha 没被 cross-source confirm 过 → 反而**没被前人吃** → 更新鲜。\n- 实测：train NAV 2.09 < anchor 2.19, 砍 16 笔后 NAV 跌 -4%。\n\n## 实现 (Implementation)\n- 主脚本：`/Users/han/project/alpha/alpha_second_v1/arcs/all/260516a_agent_team_beat_current_sota/team_d/scripts/round_1_runner.py`\n- 步骤：anchor G2 → post-filter keep leg if `lc_24h == 0`.\n- 124 笔。\n\n## Past-only window 处理\n- `lc_24h` past-only (events `event_time < t`).\n- `#leak/clean`.\n\n## 结果 (Results)\n| | NAV | Trades | Sharpe | Win | MaxDD |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| Train | 2.0927 | 124 | 8.20 | 87.1% | -1.01% |\n| Val (rolling 13w) | 1.0571 ± 0.069 | - | - | - | - |\n| Test | NOT RUN (train fail) | - | - | - | - |\n| **Δ train NAV vs anchor** | -0.096 | -16 | +0.50 | +1.4pp | 0 |\n\n## 风险 & overfit 嫌疑\n- overfit_score = 0.\n- mechanism 正方向（win/sharpe 略升），但砍 leg 太多 → NAV 净降。\n\n## Lineage（双链网）\n- **derived_from**: [[arc_260516a__team_anchor__anchor_g2__baseline]]\n- **antithesis_of**: [[arc_260516a__team_d__D-R1-1__consensus_gte1]] (R1-1 keep ≥1，R1-2 keep ==0)\n- **competes_with**: [[arc_260516a__team_d__D-R1-3__drop_full_consensus]]\n- **builds against**: [[arc_260516a__team_anchor__anchor_g2__baseline]]\n\n## Reports\n- `/Users/han/project/alpha/alpha_second_v1/arcs/all/260516a_agent_team_beat_current_sota/team_d/output/cross_round_leaderboard_nav.csv` (D-R1-2)\n- [[arc_260516a__reporter_20260517_0547]]\n\n## Notes / 下次迭代\n- R1-1 / R1-2 / R1-3 三种 cross-source 切片在 anchor pool 上**都不能 strict beat anchor**。说明 cross-source signal 在 anchor pipeline 自身的 ratio_gate / volume_cap 上**已经被吃掉**，post-filter 没法再榨出 alpha。\n- 替代设计：cross-source 信号应该接进 **sizing layer**（同 ratio_norm 一样作 size factor），而不是作 admit/drop binary gate。这是 H 系列还未探的方向 —— 下次 arc 可补。\n"
  :path "experiments/arc_260516a__team_d__D-R1-2__isolated_keep.md"
